        "patch": "Index: poem.md\n===================================================================\n--- poem.md\t\n+++ poem.md\t\n@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+## Invoices\n+\n+Paper trails in quiet lines,\n+Numbers march in tidy rows;\n+Due dates hum like clockwork signs,\n+Promises inside the notes.\n+\n+With every stamp and tax and fee,\n+I count the work you asked me do;\n+Then wait for grace and clarity—\n+From “sent” to “paid,” and through.\n+\n+If you read, remember this:\n+Behind each total, time and craft;\n+A balance of what’s owed to us—\n+A small receipt for what we’ve built.\n",
